      "sourceTextSha256": "d68cbc9762300a18b01ee771577f3ea6e1271c550b5c1acb78791404ef312b6e",
      "text": "Day 11 · Breakfast, then a private panoramic tour (4 hours) with an English-speaking guide: the Bay of Cartagena, the Muelle de los Pegasos, the Clock Tower and the Manga neighbourhood, with its Moorish and Republican architecture; the imposing Castillo de San Felipe de Barajas; and the walled historic centre, with time for craft shopping and a walk through its streets and squares, including the Church of San Pedro Claver and the Santo Domingo bastion.",
